<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>My Rails App</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #06b6d4);
      color: white;
    }

    .container {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 100px 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 18px;
      opacity: 0.9;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 30px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      margin: 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: white;
      color: #4f46e5;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #f3f4f6;
    }

    .btn-outline {
      border: 2px solid white;
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      background: white;
      color: #06b6d4;
    }

    .card-section {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 60px;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      color: black;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      width: 250px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 80px;
      font-size: 14px;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">
    <h1>Welcome to My Rails App 🚀</h1>
    <p>
      This is your first beautiful Rails homepage. You can now start building real features like authentication, APIs, and dashboards.
    </p>

    <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</a>
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline">Learn More</a>

    <div class="card-section">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>⚡ Fast Setup</h3>
        <p>Rails helps you build apps quickly with less code.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🛠️ Powerful Tools</h3>
        <p>Everything you need for backend development included.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🌍 Scalable</h3>
        <p>From small projects to large systems, Rails scales easily.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
      Built with ❤️ using Ruby on Rails
    </footer>
  </div>

</body>
</html>